cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite the paper (preferred-citation); if you use the bureau_to_workout code, also cite the software."
title: "bureau-to-workout: credit scoring and causal debt resolution under policy-shaped labels"
abstract: >-
  Reference code for a preprint on credit-risk labels that the credit system
  itself produces: a credit-bureau simulator and an asset-management workout
  simulator that keep counterfactual outcomes, and an estimator for each label
  mechanism: bureau-augmented reject inference (selection), masking-aware
  delayed labels after a moratorium (masking), and a cross-fitted DR-learner
  with budget-constrained offer policies and off-policy evaluation
  (treatment). All data are synthetic.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Chongmankhong
    given-names: Thanatchon
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-10
license: MIT
